{title: Zindagi Ka Safar}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Kalyanji Anandji}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
Zinda[F]gi ka sa[Gm]far,        hai yeh[Eb]kaisa safar ?
Koi[Eb]samjha[F]nahi;        koi[Bb]jaana[F]nahi.

{c: Verse 1}
Zinda[F]gi ko bo[F]hut pyaar        [C]humne diy[F]aa.
Maut[F]se bhi[Gm]mohabbat        ni[Bb]bhaaenge[F]hum.
Rote-[F]rote za[F]maane mein        [C]aaye ma[F]gar.
Hanste-[F]hanste[Gm]zamaane se        [Bb]jaaenge[F]hum.
Jaaen[F]ge par ki[Gm]dhar,        hai[Eb]kisey yeh khabar
Koi[Eb]samjha[F]nahi;        koi[Bb]jaana[F]nahi.

{c: Verse 1}
Aise[F]jeevan bhi[F]hain,        jo[C]jiye hi[F]nahi.
Jinko[F]jeene se[Gm]pehle        hi[Bb]maut aaga[F]yi.
Phool[F]aise bhi[F]hain,        jo khi[C]le hi[F]nahi.
Jinko[F]khilne se[Gm]pehle        fi[C]za kha ga[F]yi.
Hai[F]pareshaan na[Gm]zar;        thak[Eb]gaye chaahakar.
Koi[Eb]samjha[F]nahi;        koi[Bb]jaana[F]nahi.

